    298.150  1800.00007 -2.0 -1.0  0.0  1.0  2.0  3.0  4.0  0.0            0.000
-9.355859541D+04 6.498110110D+01 5.453980352D+00 7.944268965D-04 6.869919807D-08
-2.233682699D-11 3.125170349D-15                -4.450147179D+04-2.642682805D+01
ZnCO3(cr)         Robie & Hemingway 1995 USGS Bull 2131 Cp(T),S,dfH; NASA-9 fit (Kerotakis)
